    title: "hwattest-eval/1 labeled hardware-authenticity dataset (local release)"
    authors:
      - family-names: Boudreaux
        given-names: Scott
        affiliation: Elyan Labs
    year: 2026
    notes: >-
      41 labeled hwattest measurement runs from one host (bare metal, docker,
      KVM, hidden KVM, QEMU TCG, hardened TCG). Derived features and per-sample
      timings only; no machine identifiers. See eval/DATASHEET.md.
